  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">This is hydrohalogenation reaction of alkene. This is an electrophilic addition reaction. Addition occurs via Markovnikov&#39;s rule.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HBr</mi></math> adds to the double bond of the styrene forming 1-bromo-1-phenylethane.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e60f2a4f-88b1-4998-99c5-434034b90414-image.png\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 117px;\" /></p>",
